    "Official UIFlow1/UIFlow2 exact AtomU projects were fetched independently: name and description explicitly identify AtomU, beyond the shared ATOM_SERIES device ID. This supersedes a tutorial-only UIFlow discovery result, while factory identity and execution compatibility remain unknown.",
